{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/49ac197a98c99c7bdf82322ed0529c8d.avif?t=1769134865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras_big/49ac197a98c99c7bdf82322ed0529c8d.avif?t=1769134865 width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Caelum, the truth is already dead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volatile squad of social opposites are forced to unite.</strong> They aren't traditional heroes; they're a powder keg waiting to blow. Yet this fractured team is the only thing standing between the world and total collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they settle conflicts across the world, the mission starts to rot from the inside. History doesn't add up. This isn't just a war for peace anymore-- it\u2019s a desperate claw for reality. Step into the crossfire between gospel and deception, and unravel the mysteries that <strong>lie</strong> within\u00a0<strong>Caelum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a passion project heavily influenced by the PSX JRPG era.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kinetic Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget static menus. Master an <strong>Input Combo System</strong> where your timing dictates your power. Chain specific inputs to unleash devastating techniques, and force critical attacks  by timing them correctly. Execute perfect guards to survive punishing blows! And to top it all off, all characters serve unique kits that involve taking advantage of both mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/2c56a02b3c65f74678ed247e90602c99.poster.avif?t=1769134865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/2c56a02b3c65f74678ed247e90602c99.webm?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/2c56a02b3c65f74678ed247e90602c99.mp4?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Role-Based Strategy\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging bosses that demand mastery of combat roles. Success requires more than grinding; it requires understanding the synergy of your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/92c8b08993779e89b5dfd9ccae1bc3f4.poster.avif?t=1769134865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/92c8b08993779e89b5dfd9ccae1bc3f4.webm?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/92c8b08993779e89b5dfd9ccae1bc3f4.mp4?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playstyle-Altering Gear\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover equipment that goes beyond stat buffs. Find rare items that fundamentally change character roles or reinforce your favorite playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/a9044a9a4a94487da082e57cddced9ff.poster.avif?t=1769134865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/a9044a9a4a94487da082e57cddced9ff.webm?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/a9044a9a4a94487da082e57cddced9ff.mp4?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Trusted Companion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your characters are not the only ones participating in the battlefield. Introducing Link Catalysts: tiny, sentient floating robots capable of combat support. These also hold the keys to a powerful transformation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/18b2a7f8884ff2288cd88f7443a0e934.poster.avif?t=1769134865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/18b2a7f8884ff2288cd88f7443a0e934.webm?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/18b2a7f8884ff2288cd88f7443a0e934.mp4?t=1769134865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets in the Static</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world teeming with side quests, minigames (BURST TCG), and deep lore hidden in the corners of a world that was never meant to be questioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/ad870e23bc386b441c5e0df6b93656f7.poster.avif?t=1769134865\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour